        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "text": "I smiled, watching those kids."
    },
    {
        "text": "If they were going to survive, they had to kill that seed of doubt."
    },
    {
        "text": "You only suffer if you survive."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like a moth to a flame, a worm in a hole."
    },
    {
        "text": "You have to chase something, even at a cost."
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't that right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Talulah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
